 of Shikagura Rabin)\nShikaku Rabin comes from the future, but he is unable to return home because he cannot fix or operate his broken time machine. However, being a fool, he takes this matter lightly and lives happily in the present day, thinking that he can't go back. That's why he doesn't know much about common sense.\n\nI am sorry for specifying the details.\nThis is not a request for a picture to be used for something, but something that I genuinely want, but I may use it in the future for advertising.\n\nThis time, I would like to emphasize the atmosphere in the picture and the gentle and lonely atmosphere of the scenery that Ontake-san draws, rather than the cuteness of the character.\nI would be happy if you could draw Shikaku Rabin with his backside (while keeping the feeling that he is Shikaku Rabin), or draw the person close-up, or draw him wide as if he is pointing a camera at you from a distance, or any other composition that you think would be nice. It is also OK to change the content slightly!\n\nIf the content is too difficult, you can return it to ......!\nI would like to make another request with a different content at that time.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hc_feee/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3250390, "client_id": 2506691, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52958af58b044ee91690af665b2d1c34", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52958af58b044ee91690af665b2d1c34, https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=c